e.",\u8232 "reason": "It directly supports sentence reduction despite non-compoundability but does not identify the particular offence as grievous hurt.",\u8232 "confidence": "high"\u8232 \}\u8232 ],\u8232 "good_answer_present": "Yes",\u8232 "best_passage_no": 8,\u8232 "caveats": ""\u8232 \}\
